# Gaussian Blur

## 🎯 Objective

- Learn how to reduce image noise using Gaussian Blur.
- Understand the effect of different kernel sizes on image smoothing.
- Improve image quality before applying further image processing techniques.

## 🔄 Flow

Input Image
      │
      ▼
Read Image
      │
      ▼
Apply Gaussian Blur
      │
      ▼
Display Blurred Image
      │
      ▼
Save Output Image


# Binary Thresholding

## 🎯 Objective

- Learn how to convert an image into a binary (black and white) image.
- Understand the concept of threshold values.
- Prepare images for segmentation and object detection.

## 🔄 Flow

Input Image
      │
      ▼
Read Image
      │
      ▼
Convert to Grayscale
      │
      ▼
Apply Binary Threshold
      │
      ▼
Display Threshold Image
      │
      ▼
Save Output Image


# Motion Detection using OpenCV

## 🎯 Objective

- Learn how to capture live video from a webcam.
- Detect moving objects using frame differencing.
- Identify object boundaries using contour detection.
- Draw bounding boxes around detected moving objects.
- Display the motion detection status in real time.

## 🔄 Flow

Start Webcam
      │
      ▼
Capture Video Frame
      │
      ▼
Convert to Grayscale
      │
      ▼
Apply Gaussian Blur
      │
      ▼
Compare with First Frame
      │
      ▼
Apply Threshold
      │
      ▼
Dilate Image
      │
      ▼
Find Contours
      │
      ▼
Is Contour Area > Threshold?
      │
   Yes │ No
      ▼
Draw Bounding Box
      │
      ▼
Display "Moving Object Detected"
      │
      ▼
Show Video Feed
